# Edge redirect for the language root.
# Sends `/` straight to the default locale at the CDN edge (HTTP 302) so the
# browser never has to download the SPA shell and boot the client router just
# to run a `goto('/es/')`. This removes a full round-trip from FCP/LCP on the
# tested entry URL. Mirrors the client-side fallback in src/routes/+page.svelte.
/  /es/  302
